# budget from 500-fill-loop-word-runtime-value.ref: the course solution's count, widened by 10% and rounded up, plus one, and at least three more than the count
instructions <= 50
blocks <= 18
count(call) <= 5
count(load) <= 3
count(store) <= 6
count(phi) <= 6
